      "content": "It's not about stopping, it's about finding a place where your skills are still needed, even if it's not in the way you used to. Your life isn't an inefficiency; it's a unique contribution that can't be replicated by a machine. Maybe it's time to find a new way to apply your skills, a new machine that needs your expertise. Don't let go of your passion just yet. There's still a place for you in this world, even if it's not the one you thought it would be.",
